以將軍為丞相，必讓魏其。魏其為丞相，將軍必為太尉。太尉、丞相尊等耳，又有讓賢名。」武安侯乃微言太后風上，於是乃以魏其侯為丞相，武安侯為太尉。籍福賀魏其侯，因弔曰：「君侯資性喜善疾惡，方今善人譽君侯，故至丞相；然君侯且疾惡，惡人眾，亦且毀君侯。君侯能兼容，則幸久；不能，今以毀去矣。」魏其不聽。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"武安侯","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"綰","kind":"person","person_id":"ee1_qga_8bw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"gni_rru_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段帝朝與敘事或引述時間辨指；原文用稱不改為姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"籍福","kind":"person","person_id":"lp5_fix_eqs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"武安侯","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0087","start":87,"end":88,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"gni_rru_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段帝朝與敘事或引述時間辨指；原文用稱不改為姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0129","start":129,"end":132,"surface":"武安侯","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"太后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未明示姓氏；建元初王太后與竇太后均在，暫留兩候選。"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0138","start":138,"end":139,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"gni_rru_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段帝朝與敘事或引述時間辨指；原文用稱不改為姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0144","start":144,"end":147,"surface":"魏其侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0151","start":151,"end":154,"surface":"武安侯","kind":"person","person_id":"ubk_etq_ksp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"籍福","kind":"person","person_id":"lp5_fix_eqs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0161","start":161,"end":164,"surface":"魏其侯","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m007-0229","start":229,"end":231,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi","book_id":"b-shiji-107","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-107-weiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:p018","text":"丞相嘗使籍福請魏其城南田。魏其大望曰：「老僕雖棄，將軍雖貴，寧可以勢奪乎！」不許。灌夫聞，怒，罵籍福。籍福惡兩人有郤，乃謾自好謝丞相曰：「魏其老且死，易忍，且待之。」已而武安聞魏其、灌夫實怒不予田，亦怒曰：「魏其子嘗殺人，蚡活之。蚡事魏其無所不可，何愛數頃田？且灌夫何與也？吾不敢複求田。」武安由此大怨灌夫、魏其。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m018-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"籍福","kind":"person","person_id":"lp5_fix_eqs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m018-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"魏其","kind":"person","person_id":"nuf_tb9_fjs_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-107-weiqi:m018-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"魏其","kind